# LTIR 历史卷 · 已修「没考虑周全」标本（v2，0.2.0 正式词条）
# 全卷 0 三态：只登记旧错输出与修后输出；reformulate 必须配 sig: + by:。
# 「先看见，再补」：reflect: gaps 列出全部 id；规则复现不了修后输出即弃权。

problem: history-gaps
status: ledger
ref: PATCH_0.1.2.md, PATCH_0.2.0.md, fixtures/indeterminate.ltir

sig: ltir_quad_sign : Poly -> Set
gap: quad_disc_neg   where: disc < 0
reformulate: ltir_quad_sign(A, op) = sign_table(A, op)
witness: solve: x^2 + 1 >= 0  ->  x ∈ R
by: cert-quad-002

sig: ltir_rat_div : Rat -> Rat -> Rat
gap: div_self_square   where: y.a * y.a overflows
reformulate: ltir_rat_div(a, b, c, d) = a*d/(b*c)
witness: V: 1/110000000000000000  ->  1/110000000000000000
by: cert-ratdiv-001

gap: sci_upper_e   where: token ends with E<digits>
reformulate: ltir_sci_number(m, e) = m * 10^e
witness: V: 1.1E17  ->  110000000000000000
by: cert-sci-003

quote: <ltir> V: 2sqrt(2) </ltir>
reflect: gaps
reflect: rules
depth: 12

# ── 0.2.1 纯实践收编：失败留痕（负面 witness，不粉成前奏）──
gap: zero_new_word_trap where: 零新词试验把立法塞进 C++ 隐式约定
witness: 同 fn 两条宏 last-wins / file_line 漂移 / L3a 漏扫 witness 体 等七格
by: cert-reject-021

gap: r2_three_bugs where: 第三态漏禁 / reflect 无 stdout / L1 文档措辞
witness: 三格修订后 trial_rewrite 95 项，干净基底全绿
by: cert-r2-001

gap: verdict_tail_restored where: 词库外判定词曾静默吞尾巴给实算值
witness: smoke009 第 43 条期望同步为 E-SYN，全禁版补回
by: cert-tail-001
reflect: gaps
